appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way.  <br><br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event <span class=\"strong\">not</span> connected to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the Present Perfect there is a connection between what happened in the past and now. You use time markers like <span class=\"italic\">for</span>, <span class=\"italic\">since</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ever</span> with the Present Perfect.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use the Past Simple, the time is always past. You use time markers with the past like: <span class=\"italic\">then</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ago</span>, <span class=\"italic\">yesterday</span>, <span class=\"italic\">when I was ...</span> with the Simple Past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"strong italic\">have/has</span> + <span class=\"strong\">the past participle</span> of the verb in Present Perfect sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart about how to form the Present Perfect tense:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past tense form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past participle form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pounded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pounded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Your head has pounded ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"become\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"became\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"become\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Home remedies have become ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You have had ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"showed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shown\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Recent studies have shown ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Recent studies have shown that this herb does in fact ease migraines.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You have had enough! ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Would</span> to Talk About Past Habits", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Used to</span> and <span class=\"strong\">would</span> are both used to talk about past actions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">used to</span> to express something that we often did in the past, but don't do anymore. It is often used to talk about something that was a habit, or a way of life in the past. We use it to contrast past habits with present situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Used to</span> can refer to situations as well as habitual actions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">would</span> to refer to past actions and habits as well.  <br> <span class=\"strong\">Would</span> only refers to actions, but not situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Shamans used to help those with frequent headaches.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They would carefully bore a hole into the patient's skull.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tense", "type": "name"}, {"content": "anxious; unable to relax ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was a tense day at work. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about headaches.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pound", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to beat with force ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My head has been pounding all day! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pill ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "medication; tablet  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I took two pills and my headache was gone! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shaman", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in some religions, the person who has power over good and evil  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Shamans used to help those with regular headaches.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Stone Age", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the time in history when humans used stone tools  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Stone Age shaman cured headaches. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "healer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who cures illnesses  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A healer would rub oil on the person's head to cure a headache. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "herb", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plant used for medicine ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They used to treat headaches with the feverfew herb.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "migraine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a severe headache ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He had a migraine all afternoon. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to rub", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to press and move in a circular motion ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The healer would rub oil on a person's head to relieve the headache.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Interview several people and fill in the chart.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Collect the information then write a paragraph about how people treat headaches today.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Person interviewed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Headache remedy they use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I interview several people about headaches and remedies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph with the information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}]}]}